<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Collagenex.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Collagenex.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it reiterated a strong buy rating on Collagenex Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>-- said expected the company to present positive results of a pivotal Phase III trial of Periostat on March 21.</p>
<p>-- said expects data to show Periostat treatment resulted in a statistically significant improvement in periodontal health in patience with periodontal disease.</p>
<p>-- expects the company to receive approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration in late 1997.</p>
<p>-- reiterated a 12-month price target of $23-$28 a share.</p>
<p>-- Collagenex gained 1-1/2 to 14.</p>
</text>
